  <p id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p001:m0000" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD">張岱</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p001:m0003" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD">景山</persName>，吳郡吳人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p001:m0013" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAA">敞</persName>，晉度支尚書，父<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangdai-family:p001:m0022" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAA">茂度</persName>，宋金紫光祿大夫。</p>
